flowchart TD
  INPUT[User prompt] --> SAVE[Append user message]
  SAVE --> LIMITS{Cancelled or over budget?}
  LIMITS -->|Yes| STOP[Finish with reason]
  LIMITS -->|No| CONTEXT[Build and compact context]
  CONTEXT --> PROVIDER[Stream provider events]
  PROVIDER --> TURN[Accumulate and journal assistant turn]
  TURN --> CALLS{Tool calls?}
  CALLS -->|No| ANSWER[Finish answer and usage]
  CALLS -->|Yes| CHECK[Validate arguments and run pre-hook]
  CHECK --> POLICY[Check live permissions]
  POLICY --> RESULT[Run or deny tool]
  RESULT --> POST[Post-hook and shrink output]
  POST --> JOURNAL[Journal tool results]
  JOURNAL --> LIMITS
